{
 "file": "02OLB02A base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:5a",
   "ptr": "0x5a",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「難破した船に乗ってたんですか？\\n",
   "en": "\"You were on the ship that wrecked? I hear the port's going to be closed for a while. You poor thing.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:7f",
   "ptr": "0x7f",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　しばらく港は閉鎖されるんですってね、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:5a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:aa",
   "ptr": "0xaa",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  お気の毒に」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:5a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:c0",
   "ptr": "0xc0",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「森の島なら、湿原の東にあります。\\n",
   "en": "\"The Forest Island? It's east of the Marshland. Truly, it's nothing but forest. There's nothing else on that island.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:e7",
   "ptr": "0xe7",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　本当に森しかない、何もない島ですよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:c0"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:11f",
   "ptr": "0x11f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「聞いとくれ、わしゃ見たんじゃ。\\n",
   "en": "\"Listen here, I saw her, I tell you! A girl with black hair and black eyes! I told my son's wife, but she won't believe me!\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:144",
   "ptr": "0x144",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  黒い髪と黒い瞳の娘を！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:11f"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:161",
   "ptr": "0x161",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　うちの嫁に話しても、信じてくれん！」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  黒い髪と黒い瞳の娘を！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:11f"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:18f",
   "ptr": "0x18f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「聞いとくれ、わしゃ見たんじゃ。\\n",
