   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  黒い髪と黒い瞳の娘を！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:18f"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:1fb",
   "ptr": "0x1fb",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ほれ、この娘のような・・・おや？」\\f",
   "en": "Look, just like this girl here... Eh?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:22a",
   "ptr": "0x22a",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「おじちゃん、強いでしょ？\\n",
   "en": "\"You're strong, aren't you, mister? ...'Cause you look so dashing!\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:249",
   "ptr": "0x249",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "　・・・だってカッコいいもん」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:22a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:272",
   "ptr": "0x272",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「ばうばう！」\\f",
   "en": "\"Woof woof!\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:29a",
   "ptr": "0x29a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ザリガニを倒してくれたんですね！？\\n",
   "en": "\"You beat the Giant Crayfish?! Thank you so much! Because of that thing we couldn't get out to the Marshland. We were at our wits' end.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:2c3",
   "ptr": "0x2c3",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　ありがとうございます！\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:2e0",
   "ptr": "0x2e0",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  奴のおかげで湿原に出られず、頭を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　ありがとうございます！\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:307",
   "ptr": "0x307",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  かかえてたとこだったんですよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:29a"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:32f",
   "ptr": "0x32f",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「これで調査に出発することができます」\\f",
   "en": "\"Now we can finally set out on our survey.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:364",
   "ptr": "0x364",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「森の島へ行ってた学者たちは、全員引\\n",
   "en": "\"The scholars who went to the Forest Island have all pulled out. They're resting at the inn now.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:38d",
   "ptr": "0x38d",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  き上げて、今、宿屋で休んでます」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:364"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:3ba",
   "ptr": "0x3ba",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "「こら！　ここには近寄るな！」\\f",
   "en": "\"Hey! Keep away from here!\"",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:3e3",
   "ptr": "0x3e3",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「看板、見たか？　超ムカつくぜ」\\f",
   "en": "\"Seen the sign? It really ticks me off.\"",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:40e",
   "ptr": "0x40e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ったく、エライ奴らの考えるこたァ、\\n",
   "en": "\"Geez, I'll never get what goes on in them bigwigs' heads.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:437",
