   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:5bc",
   "ptr": "0x5bc",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「こんなかっこうをしてますが、実は私、\\n",
   "en": "\"I may look the part, but truth is, I'm no scholar. It was the only way I'd ever sneak onto the Forest Island. That place is the nobles' own land.",
