   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  そうにないんでね。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:5bc"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:645",
   "ptr": "0x645",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  あそこは貴族の直轄領ですから。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  そうにないんでね。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 02OLB02A:5bc"
  },
  {
   "id": "02OLB02A:66b",
   "ptr": "0x66b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　森の島には海の底へ通じる洞窟があり\\n",
